
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LearningPath | Learning & Opportunity Architecture</title>

<style>
:root{
  --cream:#F7F2E8;
  --cream2:#EEE3D1;
  --paper:#FFFCF6;
  --brown:#49352A;
  --brown2:#674C3B;
  --brown3:#8B6A50;
  --blue:#294F6D;
  --blue2:#3D6F91;
  --blue3:#729BB5;
  --blue-light:#DCEAF1;
  --sage:#54745B;
  --text:#2B2925;
  --muted:#6D6A63;
  --line:#D8D0C3;
  --shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(53,43,32,.09);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

body{
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.65;
}

a{color:inherit}

button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}

button{cursor:pointer}

.container{
  width:min(1160px,92%);
  margin:auto;
}

.section{
  padding:76px 0;
}

.section-heading{
  max-width:760px;
  margin-bottom:35px;
}

.eyebrow{
  color:var(--blue2);
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-size:.76rem;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:2px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

h1,h2,h3,h4{
  line-height:1.2;
  color:var(--brown);
}

h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.8rem)}
h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)}
h3{font-size:1.3rem}
h4{font-size:1.05rem}

p{margin:12px 0;color:var(--muted)}

.site-header{
  background:var(--paper);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:100;
}

.nav{
  min-height:76px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
}

.logo{
  font-size:1.35rem;
  font-weight:900;
  color:var(--blue);
  text-decoration:none;
  letter-spacing:-.5px;
}

.logo span{color:var(--brown3)}

.nav-links{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:20px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.nav-links a{
  text-decoration:none;
  font-size:.85rem;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--brown2);
}

.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--blue2)}

.menu-toggle{
  display:none;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--brown);
  padding:9px 12px;
  border-radius:8px;
}

.btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:8px;
  padding:13px 21px;
  border-radius:8px;
  border:1px solid transparent;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:800;
  font-size:.9rem;
  transition:.2s ease;
}

.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}

.btn-primary{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
}

.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--blue2)}

.btn-secondary{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:white;
}

.btn-outline{
  border-color:var(--blue);
  color:var(--blue);
  background:transparent;
}

.btn-light{
  background:var(--paper);
  color:var(--brown);
}

.hero{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%,rgba(114,155,181,.27),transparent 32%),
    linear-gradient(120deg,#F7F2E8 0%,#EEE3D1 100%);
  padding:90px 0 85px;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.hero-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
  gap:55px;
  align-items:center;
}

.hero h1{max-width:760px}

.hero h1 span{color:var(--blue2)}

.hero-copy{
  max-width:680px;
  font-size:1.12rem;
  margin:22px 0 28px;
}

.hero-actions{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:25px;
}

.hero-panel{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:30px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.hero-panel h3{color:white;margin-bottom:20px}

.hero-step{
  display:flex;
  gap:14px;
  padding:14px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
}

.hero-step:last-child{border:0}

.step-number{
  min-width:35px;
  height:35px;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--cream2);
  color:var(--brown);
  font-weight:900;
}

.hero-step strong{display:block;color:white}
.hero-step small{color:#DCEAF1}

.intro-band{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:white;
  padding:30px 0;
}

.intro-band p{
  color:#F4EDE2;
  margin:0;
  font-size:1.05rem;
  max-width:1000px;
}

.cards{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:22px;
}

.card{
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:15px;
  padding:25px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.card h3{margin:12px 0}
.card p{font-size:.94rem}

.card-icon{
  width:48px;
  height:48px;
  border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  font-size:1.4rem;
}

.framework{
  background:var(--paper);
}

.framework-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:16px;
}

.framework-step{
  padding:23px;
  border-radius:13px;
  background:var(--cream);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}

.framework-step .number{
  color:var(--blue2);
  font-size:1.8rem;
  font-weight:900;
}

.framework-step h3{margin:8px 0}

.note{
  padding:18px 20px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  border-left:4px solid var(--blue2);
  border-radius:8px;
  margin:25px 0;
  color:var(--brown);
}

.note p{color:var(--brown2);margin:5px 0 0}

.assessment-wrap{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;
  gap:30px;
  align-items:start;
}

.assessment-intro{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:white;
  padding:30px;
  border-radius:17px;
  position:sticky;
  top:105px;
}

.assessment-intro h3{color:white;font-size:1.6rem}
.assessment-intro p{color:#F1E7D8}

.assessment-form{
  background:var(--paper);
  padding:30px;
  border-radius:17px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.form-group{margin-bottom:22px}

.form-group label{
  display:block;
  font-weight:800;
  color:var(--brown);
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.form-group select,
.form-group input,
.form-group textarea{
  width:100%;
  padding:13px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:white;
  border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--text);
}

.form-group textarea{
  min-height:110px;
  resize:vertical;
}

.form-group select:focus,
.form-group input:focus,
.form-group textarea:focus{
  outline:2px solid var(--blue3);
  border-color:var(--blue);
}

.result-box{
  display:none;
  margin-top:25px;
  padding:25px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  border:1px solid var(--blue3);
  border-radius:12px;
}

.result-box h3{color:var(--blue)}
.result-box ul{padding-left:20px;margin:12px 0}
.result-box li{margin:7px 0;color:var(--brown2)}

.result-actions{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  margin-top:20px;
}

.tools-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:22px;
}

.tool-card{
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:15px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.tool-card-content{padding:24px}
.tool-card h3{margin-bottom:10px}

.tool-label{
  display:inline-block;
  color:var(--blue);
  background:var(--blue-light);
  padding:5px 10px;
  border-radius:30px;
  font-size:.75rem;
  font-weight:800;
}

.tool-card ul{
  margin:14px 0 0;
  padding-left:19px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.9rem;
}

.tool-card li{margin:5px 0}

.offer{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),#203D55);
  color:white;
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:40px;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
  gap:30px;
  align-items:center;
}

.offer h2{color:white}
.offer p{color:#E5EDF2}

.price{
  font-size:2.7rem;
  font-weight:900;
  color:white;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

.offer-list{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:9px 20px;
  margin:23px 0;
}

.offer-list div{color:#F3F0E8}
.offer-list div:before{
  content:"✓";
  margin-right:9px;
  color:#C6DDBF;
  font-weight:900;
}

.process-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  gap:16px;
}

.process-card{
  background:var(--cream2);
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:22px;
  border-top:4px solid var(--blue2);
}

.process-card h3{margin:10px 0}

.advanced{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:white;
}

.advanced h2,.advanced h3,.advanced h4{color:white}
.advanced .eyebrow{color:#C5DCE9}
.advanced .section-heading p{color:#E8DED1}

.advanced-intro{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:14px;
  margin-bottom:35px;
}

.advanced-intro p{color:#F1E7D8}

.advanced-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:18px;
  margin:25px 0 40px;
}

.advanced-card{
  background:#F7F2E8;
  color:var(--text);
  padding:23px;
  border-radius:13px;
  border-top:5px solid var(--blue3);
}

.advanced-card h3{color:var(--brown)}
.advanced-card p{color:var(--muted)}

.advanced-card .card-icon{background:var(--blue-light)}

.table-wrap{
  overflow-x:auto;
  margin:22px 0 35px;
  border-radius:12px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:var(--paper);
}

table{
  border-collapse:collapse;
  width:100%;
  min-width:700px;
}

th{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  text-align:left;
  padding:15px;
  font-size:.9rem;
}

td{
  padding:15px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  color:var(--brown2);
  font-size:.9rem;
  vertical-align:top;
}

tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F4EEE3}

.advanced-subtitle{
  margin:40px 0 15px;
  font-size:1.7rem;
}

.stage-list{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:16px;
  margin:20px 0;
}

.stage{
  background:#F7F2E8;
  color:var(--brown);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:22px;
}

.stage h3{color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:10px}
.stage p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}

.pipeline{
  background:#203D55;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:13px;
  margin:25px 0;
  text-align:center;
}

.pipeline-flow{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
}

.pipeline-item{
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--brown);
  padding:14px 18px;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.pipeline-arrow{color:white;font-size:1.5rem}

.example-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:18px;
}

.example{
  background:#F7F2E8;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:13px;
}

.example h3{color:var(--blue)}
.example p{color:var(--muted)}

.template{
  background:#F7F2E8;
  color:var(--brown);
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:13px;
  margin:20px 0;
  border-left:5px solid var(--blue3);
}

.template p{color:var(--brown2)}
.template strong{color:var(--blue)}

.audit-list{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:12px;
  margin:20px 0;
}

.audit-item{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  align-items:flex-start;
  background:#F7F2E8;
  color:var(--brown);
  padding:17px;
  border-radius:10px;
}

.audit-item input{
  width:18px;
  height:18px;
  margin-top:4px;
  accent-color:var(--blue);
  flex-shrink:0;
}

.audit-progress{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  height:12px;
  border-radius:20px;
  overflow:hidden;
  margin:18px 0 8px;
}

.audit-progress-bar{
  width:0%;
  height:100%;
  background:#A9C7D8;
  transition:width .25s ease;
}

.audit-status{color:#E9E1D5;font-size:.9rem}

.faq-list{
  display:grid;
  gap:12px;
  max-width:900px;
}

.faq-item{
  background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.faq-question{
  width:100%;
  background:none;
  border:0;
  text-align:left;
  padding:19px 22px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-weight:800;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:15px;
}

.faq-answer{
  display:none;
  padding:0 22px 20px;
}

.faq-answer p{margin:0}

.faq-item.open .faq-answer{display:block}

.final-cta{
  background:var(--cream2);
  text-align:center;
  padding:65px 20px;
}

.final-cta p{
  max-width:680px;
  margin:15px auto 25px;
}

.site-footer{
  background:#2C241F;
  color:#F7F2E8;
  padding:30px 0;
}

.footer-content{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.site-footer p{color:#D8CFC2;margin:0;font-size:.85rem}

.small-print{
  font-size:.82rem;
  color:var(--muted);
}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero-grid,.assessment-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .assessment-intro{position:static}
  .cards,.framework-grid,.advanced-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .process-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .offer{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stage-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}

@media(max-width:680px){
  .nav{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 0}
  .menu-toggle{display:block}
  .nav-links{
    display:none;
    width:100%;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:flex-start;
    padding:10px 0 15px;
  }
  .nav-links.show{display:flex}
  .hero{padding:60px 0}
  .section{padding:55px 0}
  .cards,.framework-grid,.tools-grid,.advanced-grid,
  .process-grid,.stage-list,.example-grid,.audit-list{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }
  .offer{padding:27px}
  .offer-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .assessment-form{padding:20px}
  .hero-panel{padding:23px}
  .price{font-size:2.3rem}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#home">Learning<span>Path</span></a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks">☰ Menu</button>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#approach">Our Approach</a>
      <a href="#assessment">Needs Assessment</a>
      <a href="#tools">Learning Tools</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="#architecture">Opportunity Architecture</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQs</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Learning strategy • Career development • Opportunity design</div>
      <h1>Build a path.<br><span>Learn with direction.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        LearningPath helps you organize your learning, identify skill gaps,
        evaluate opportunities, and turn education into practical evidence
        that supports your next career or business move.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#assessment">Start Your Assessment</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#approach">Explore the Framework</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-panel">
      <h3>Your learning strategy, organized</h3>
      <div class="hero-step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div><strong>Define your destination</strong><small>Clarify what you want to accomplish.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div><strong>Assess your starting point</strong><small>Identify existing skills and missing capabilities.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div><strong>Choose your learning route</strong><small>Compare courses, credentials, projects, and experiences.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div><strong>Practice and demonstrate</strong><small>Build evidence of what you can actually do.</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="intro-band">
  <div class="container">
    <p>
      Finding information is not the same as building a future. Courses,
      videos, books, certifications, apprenticeships, projects, and communities
      become more useful when they are organized around a clear goal, realistic
      schedule, financial plan, and practical outcome.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- APPROACH -->
<section class="section" id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">The problem we solve</div>
      <h2>Turn scattered learning into a structured plan.</h2>
      <p>
        You do not necessarily need more resources. You need a way to decide
        which resources matter, what order to use them in, and what to do
        with what you learn.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🔎</div>
        <h3>Too Many Resources</h3>
        <p>
          You find courses, tutorials, books, and opportunities but do not
          know which ones are relevant, credible, affordable, or worth your time.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🧭</div>
        <h3>No Clear Sequence</h3>
        <p>
          You start learning without knowing which skills come first,
          what prerequisites matter, or how each activity supports the larger goal.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📂</div>
        <h3>Nothing to Demonstrate</h3>
        <p>
          You complete learning activities but have no organized projects,
          work samples, documentation, or portfolio evidence to show for them.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FRAMEWORK -->
<section class="section framework">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">The LearningPath framework</div>
      <h2>A repeatable learning cycle</h2>
      <p>
        Each stage has a purpose. You can revisit earlier stages when your
        goals, available resources, or circumstances change.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="framework-grid">
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">01</div>
        <h3>Explore</h3>
        <p>Identify career possibilities, interests, industries, and meaningful outcomes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">02</div>
        <h3>Assess</h3>
        <p>Compare your existing knowledge with the skills and requirements of your goal.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">03</div>
        <h3>Select</h3>
        <p>Choose relevant courses, books, tutorials, credentials, mentors, or practical experiences.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">04</div>
        <h3>Plan</h3>
        <p>Organize time, cost, equipment, prerequisites, and available support.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">05</div>
        <h3>Practice</h3>
        <p>Apply what you learn through exercises, simulations, assignments, and projects.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="framework-step">
        <div class="number">06</div>
        <h3>Demonstrate</h3>
        <p>Document results with work samples, project notes, portfolios, and verified credentials.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
      <strong>Important distinction:</strong>
      <p>
        Completing a course shows participation or completion. Demonstrating
        a skill requires evidence of what you can produce, explain, improve,
        or perform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NEEDS ASSESSMENT -->
<section class="section" id="assessment">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">Start with your current situation</div>
      <h2>Learning and Career Needs Assessment</h2>
      <p>
        Answer these questions to receive a starting recommendation.
        Your results are generated in this browser and are not submitted to a server.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="assessment-wrap">
      <aside class="assessment-intro">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#C5DCE9">Before choosing a course</div>
        <h3>Build around your actual circumstances.</h3>
        <p>
          A useful plan considers your current experience, available time,
          financial resources, learning preferences, and intended outcome.
        </p>
        <p>
          There is no requirement to know your exact career destination.
          Exploration can be your first stage.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="assessment-form">
        <form id="needsForm">

          <div class="form-group">
