      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Clear inputs:</strong> Required information and inputs are documented.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Clear outputs:</strong> Expected results can be inspected and tested.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Dependency review:</strong> Required tools and dependencies are identified.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Permission:</strong> Data and systems are accessed only with authorization.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Risk containment:</strong> The prototype does not disrupt existing operations.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Evidence:</strong> Testing results and limitations are documented.</span></label>
      <label class="audit-item"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>Operational value:</strong> The benefit can be explained and evaluated.</span></label>
    </div>

    <div class="audit-progress">
      <div class="audit-progress-bar" id="auditProgressBar"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="audit-status" id="auditStatus" aria-live="polite">0 of 8 audit items completed.</div>
    <button class="btn btn-light" type="button" id="printAudit" style="margin-top:18px">Print System Audit</button>

  </div>
</section>

